  "$unreachableEscalators": {
    "$comment": [
      "Escalators the issue's table asks for that CANNOT be produced through the public propose",
      "API as authority-service is currently wired. Recorded here rather than faked, because a",
      "seeded approval that claims a self-dealing escalation which the engine did not actually",
      "fire would be a demo of a lie.",
      "",
      "Both are server-derived in EvaluationContext.BuildDocument(), which OVERWRITES whatever",
      "the caller supplies:",
      "  document[\"actor\"]   <- ActorContext  (so actor.signaturesInWindow is always 0)",
      "  context.selfDealing <- ActorContext.SelfDealing (ApprovalsController always passes false)"
    ],
    "self-dealing": "ActorContextFactory.Create is called without selfDealing:true from ApprovalsController, so context.selfDealing is always false.",
    "velocity": "ActorContext.SignaturesInWindow is never populated from storage, so actor.signaturesInWindow is always 0."
  }
}
